        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"f6e4dd98-e5d1-4506-afd3-e3fb3eb37727\",\"review_text\":\"If u cant play the song again, cant play the song u like, then whats the point to download music aap\"},{\"review_id\":\"5fe316f2-5bc5-4402-9233-66e9b1da496e\",\"review_text\":\"Too much ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"351fdac8-04f9-400b-8840-4657522108c5\",\"review_text\":\"Love music apps like Spotify and Pandora, Apple music not so much. And my choice first will always be Spotify!\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f7b234b-ce13-411e-852d-1b3f3cc417c0\",\"review_text\":\"Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"8388eb5a-e1cd-4475-b504-3378bf7b398b\",\"review_text\":\"This app is absolutely fantastic 😚\"},{\"review_id\":\"4414c7bb-f116-475c-9817-f2b8fed243a2\",\"review_text\":\"Im locked out plz help my acc was linked to a fb profile that i lost idk what to do i dont want to lose all my liked song and playlists plz helpppp i can only use spotify on my xbox cuz i logged in prior to losingy facebool acc but overall amazing app better than apple dezer or tidal\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a1ac53a-c16e-4f81-81f7-394fcac7de54\",\"review_text\":\"How was existence possible before Spotify?\"},{\"review_id\":\"98548f73-dc97-4e3e-94c5-c3fd867ea187\",\"review_text\":\"Cant even skip or forward the song , and cant even go back to the previous song... I dont think there are any features left for free users... Every feature is shifted to premium ... It used to be the best music app , but now , You lost an user ...☹️\"},{\"review_id\":\"a1b57bc9-df8d-4255-af1a-5fbb233354e5\",\"review_text\":\"😍😍😍😍😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"b208b665-f96f-432e-b582-0b0d3a26c864\",\"review_text\":\"It was a really good app until they made literally EVERYTHING need a premium subscription!!!! It was such a good app now it's just annoying and irritating. Have to delete the app until they change it back to how it was before 😡\"}]}"
